                  <msItem>
                     <title>Missale Saresburiense</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">See Chr. Wordsworth, Tracts. of Clement
                        Maydeston, HBS 7 (1894), pp. 225--31.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">A vellum inset of 2 leaves contained in MS. the
                        (Christian) names of 16 persons of whom "Quilibet sotius et conducticius
                        huius collegii tenetur ... habere memoriam"; 13 of these names agree exactly
                        with the (Christian and sur)names given from the Winchester College Statutes
                        by Kirby, Annals, pp. 503--05.</note>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
